ents_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-18T13:58:29Z","updated_at":"2025-03-18T13:58:29Z","body":"For reference, here's how ticks appear in Windows dialogs:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b7411a34-6f18-4ff1-9fa4-0942d0bdf267)\r\n\r\nAnd in Chromium:\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1335f9b5-9a30-4bc0-9f0f-272effd51396)\r\n\r\n> If we accept tick is drawn at the center, the original behavior still can't be guaranteed by the default value of tick offset, because the widget_width (the size of the slider stylebox) may be modified by users.\r\n\r\nYou can at least guarantee it for default theme.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2733356218/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2733712332","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103907#issuecomment-2733712332","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103907","id":2733712332,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6i8SPM","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-18T15:37:00Z","updated_at":"2025-03-18T15:37:00Z","body":"After consideration, I think adding top and bottom ticks makes sense, but the alignment should be changed to the upper parts of slider for top tick and lower parts for bottom tick.\r\n(now maybe I should change the title of the pr :)\r\n![屏幕截图_20250318_233223](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/558a09cd-0a55-4eb4-b842-b68f0b0198d7)\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2733712332/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2733995877","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103907#issuecomment-2733995877","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103907","id":2733995877,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6i9Xdl","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs",